// models 2 to 4 of its collection): snapshot models (not conditioned on a parameter), one GRU layer with 9 hidden units and a dense output layer, trained at 48 kHz.
// Layout, with H = 9 units: the GRU kernel w[3H] (one input; gates in the order update, reset, candidate), the recurrent weights u[3H][H] (u[k][j] is the weight of unit j in gate output k),
